      "id": "validate-profile/page-index-bound-not-utf8",
      "description": "The STRING key's ColumnIndex max for the page ending at row-01 is row-\\xff: still an upper bound, but not valid UTF-8 (KEY-6).",
      "requirements": [
        "KEY-6",
        "RG-7",
        "CHECK-2",
        "VAL-1"
