      "description": "The key ColumnIndex max of the page ending at 0xFF*80 0x02 is shortened to 0xFF*16, which is below the page's keys (the all-0xFF truncation fault RG-5 forbids).",
      "requirements": [
        "RG-5",
        "RG-7",
        "CHECK-2",
        "VAL-1"
      ],
      "requires": [
